{"displayStem":"같은 이분형 사건을 같은 추적 기간에 평가한 세 독립 무작위시험 Ⅰ·Ⅱ·Ⅲ의 결과이다. 위험차는 치료군 사건률에서 대조군 사건률을 뺀 값이며 음수는 치료군 사건이 적다는 뜻이다. 그림의 가로 막대는 표의 정수 발생수로 계산한 95% 신뢰구간이다. 두 독립 비율의 차이에 대한 Wilson 구간 기반 Newcombe 방법을 적용하였다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>세 시험의 치료 효과</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"세 시험의 치료 효과。위험차 (%p)、시험\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">시험</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-30</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-20</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-10</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"end\">Ⅲ</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">Ⅱ</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"end\">Ⅰ</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 4\"></line><line x1=\"199.65099999999998\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"388.4\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"199.65099999999998\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"199.65099999999998\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"388.4\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"388.4\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"black\"></line><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"84\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"268.269\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"344.334\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"268.269\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"268.269\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"344.334\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"344.334\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"black\"></line><circle cx=\"307\" cy=\"142\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"103.401\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"453.498\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"103.401\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"103.401\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"453.498\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"453.498\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"black\"></line><circle cx=\"280.28099999999995\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">95% 신뢰구간</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">위험차 (%p)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>시험</th><th>치료군 사건 / 대상자</th><th>대조군 사건 / 대상자</th><th>위험차</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ⅰ</td><td>5/100</td><td>15/100</td><td>-10.0%p</td></tr><tr><td>Ⅱ</td><td>20/500</td><td>65/500</td><td>-9.0%p</td></tr><tr><td>Ⅲ</td><td>2/35</td><td>6/35</td><td>-11.4%p</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}